{"seq":2,"slug":"payment-methods","title":"电商支付方式全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/payment-fundamentals/payment-methods","wordCount":1585,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"电商支付方式全景\">电商支付方式全景</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>电商平台需要根据目标市场的消费习惯、监管环境和技术基础设施，选择并整合多种支付方式。全球支付方式可分为卡支付、数字钱包、银行转账、先买后付（BNPL）和替代支付五大类。不同市场的支付偏好差异巨大——中国以支付宝/微信为主导，欧洲偏好银行转账（iDEAL、SEPA），东南亚则依赖电子钱包和便利店现金支付。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 卡支付&#10;        A1[信用卡]&#10;        A2[借记卡]&#10;        A3[预付卡]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 数字钱包&#10;        B1[支付宝/微信]&#10;        B2[Apple Pay/Google Pay]&#10;        B3[PayPal]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 银行转账&#10;        C1[网银直连]&#10;        C2[开放银行API]&#10;        C3[实时支付/UPI]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 新兴方式&#10;        D1[BNPL]&#10;        D2[加密货币]&#10;        D3[超级应用内支付]&#10;    end&#10;    A1 --&gt; E[电商收银台]&#10;    B1 --&gt; E&#10;    C1 --&gt; E&#10;    D1 --&gt; E\">graph LR\n    subgraph 卡支付\n        A1[信用卡]\n        A2[借记卡]\n        A3[预付卡]\n    end\n    subgraph 数字钱包\n        B1[支付宝/微信]\n        B2[Apple Pay/Google Pay]\n        B3[PayPal]\n    end\n    subgraph 银行转账\n        C1[网银直连]\n        C2[开放银行API]\n        C3[实时支付/UPI]\n    end\n    subgraph 新兴方式\n        D1[BNPL]\n        D2[加密货币]\n        D3[超级应用内支付]\n    end\n    A1 --&gt; E[电商收银台]\n    B1 --&gt; E\n    C1 --&gt; E\n    D1 --&gt; E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>支付类别</th>\n<th>全球市场份额</th>\n<th>增长趋势</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数字钱包</td>\n<td>~49%</td>\n<td>快速增长</td>\n<td>移动端购物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信用卡</td>\n<td>~21%</td>\n<td>平稳</td>\n<td>高客单价、跨境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>借记卡</td>\n<td>~13%</td>\n<td>缓慢下降</td>\n<td>日常消费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银行转账</td>\n<td>~7%</td>\n<td>增长（开放银行驱动）</td>\n<td>大额支付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BNPL</td>\n<td>~5%</td>\n<td>快速增长</td>\n<td>年轻用户、时尚品类</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"卡支付体系\">卡支付体系</h2><p>信用卡和借记卡仍是全球跨境电商的基础支付方式。卡支付的技术标准由 EMVCo 制定，线上场景使用卡号 + CVV + 3DS 认证的组合验证方式。</p>\n<p>卡号（PAN）通常为 16 位数字，前 6-8 位为 BIN（银行识别码），标识发卡行和卡类型。电商平台不应直接存储完整卡号，而是通过支付网关获取 Token（令牌），后续交易使用 Token 代替真实卡号。网络令牌化（Network Tokenization）由卡组织提供，相比网关令牌化具有更高的授权通过率（提升 2-5%）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CardPaymentRequest {&#10;  paymentMethodToken: string;&#10;  amount: number;&#10;  currency: string;&#10;  capture: boolean;&#10;  statementDescriptor: string;&#10;  threeDSecureAuthentication: {&#10;    version: &#39;2.1&#39; | &#39;2.2&#39;;&#10;    eci: string;&#10;    cavv: string;&#10;    dsTransId: string;&#10;  };&#10;  metadata: {&#10;    orderId: string;&#10;    customerId: string;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface NetworkToken {&#10;  tokenNumber: string;&#10;  expirationMonth: string;&#10;  expirationYear: string;&#10;  cryptogram: string;&#10;  tokenRequestorId: string;&#10;  source: &#39;visa_token_service&#39; | &#39;mastercard_digital_enablement&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CardPaymentRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  paymentMethodToken</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  capture</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  statementDescriptor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  threeDSecureAuthentication</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2.1'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2.2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    eci</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    cavv</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    dsTransId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metadata</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    customerId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NetworkToken</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tokenNumber</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expirationMonth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  expirationYear</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cryptogram</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tokenRequestorId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'visa_token_service'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'mastercard_digital_enablement'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>3D Secure 2（3DS2）是卡组织推出的在线身份验证协议，通过风险评估实现无摩擦认证。当发卡行判定交易风险较低时，可以在后台完成验证（Frictionless Flow），用户无感知；高风险交易则弹出验证页面要求输入 OTP 或生物识别。3DS2 相比 3DS1 的优势在于支持移动端原生 SDK、提供更丰富的风险数据（超过 100 个字段），以及责任转移（Liability Shift）——通过 3DS 认证的交易，拒付责任由商户转移至发卡行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数字钱包生态\">数字钱包生态</h2><p>数字钱包在全球电商支付中占比接近 50%，分为账户余额型（支付宝、PayPal）和设备绑定型（Apple Pay、Google Pay）两种模式。</p>\n<p>支付宝/微信支付的核心优势在于庞大的用户基础和丰富的场景覆盖。技术对接上，商户通过支付宝开放平台 API 创建支付订单，支付宝返回支付链接或二维码，用户在支付宝 App 内完成确认。对于 H5/PC 场景，常用的方式是生成收银台页面（cashier）或扫码支付（precreate）。</p>\n<p>Apple Pay / Google Pay 基于 NFC 和 EMV 令牌化技术。在线上场景中，商户通过 Payment Request API 或平台 SDK 调起系统级支付面板，用户通过 Face ID/指纹确认，钱包设备向卡组织请求一次性密码（DPAN + Cryptogram），交易全程不暴露真实卡号。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>钱包类型</th>\n<th>代表产品</th>\n<th>认证方式</th>\n<th>费率</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>账户余额型</td>\n<td>支付宝、PayPal</td>\n<td>密码/指纹</td>\n<td>0.6-2.9%</td>\n<td>境内消费、跨境C2C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备绑定型</td>\n<td>Apple Pay、Google Pay</td>\n<td>生物识别</td>\n<td>同卡费率</td>\n<td>高端用户、快捷结账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超级应用型</td>\n<td>GrabPay、GoPay</td>\n<td>钱包PIN</td>\n<td>1-2%</td>\n<td>东南亚本地消费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社交支付型</td>\n<td>微信支付、Venmo</td>\n<td>密码/指纹</td>\n<td>0.6-1%</td>\n<td>社交场景、小额支付</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"银行转账与开放银行\">银行转账与开放银行</h2><p>银行直连转账在欧洲和亚洲部分市场占据重要地位。荷兰的 iDEAL 占线上支付 60% 以上份额，印度的 UPI（统一支付接口）日均交易笔数超过 3 亿。</p>\n<p>开放银行（Open Banking）通过标准化 API 让第三方支付服务直接访问用户的银行账户，无需通过卡组织网络。PSD2 在欧盟范围内强制银行开放 API，催生了 Plaid、TrueLayer、Tink 等聚合服务商。Account-to-Account（A2A）支付因其低费率（通常固定费用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.20</mn><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.20-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.20</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>0.50 而非百分比）和实时到账特性，正在被大型电商平台采用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface OpenBankingPaymentRequest {&#10;  paymentType: &#39;single_immediate&#39; | &#39;single_scheduled&#39; | &#39;standing_order&#39;;&#10;  amount: {&#10;    value: string;&#10;    currency: string;&#10;  };&#10;  creditorAccount: {&#10;    iban: string;&#10;    name: string;&#10;  };&#10;  debtorAccount?: {&#10;    iban: string;&#10;    institutionId: string;&#10;  };&#10;  reference: string;&#10;  redirectUrl: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface PaymentStatusWebhook {&#10;  paymentId: string;&#10;  status: &#39;pending&#39; | &#39;authorised&#39; | &#39;executed&#39; | &#39;settled&#39; | &#39;failed&#39;;&#10;  statusUpdateDateTime: string;&#10;  statusReason?: string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OpenBankingPaymentRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  paymentType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'single_immediate'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'single_scheduled'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'standing_order'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  creditorAccount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    iban</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  debtorAccount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    iban</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    institutionId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  reference</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  redirectUrl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PaymentStatusWebhook</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  paymentId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'authorised'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'executed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'settled'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  statusUpdateDateTime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  statusReason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实时支付系统的全球版图：巴西的 PIX 自 2020 年推出以来已覆盖 1.5 亿用户，印度的 UPI 和 IMPS 构成全球最大的实时支付网络，英国的 Faster Payments 支持 7x24 实时到账。这些系统的共同特征是由央行或监管机构推动，对终端用户免费或低费率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"先买后付与新兴支付\">先买后付与新兴支付</h2><p>BNPL（Buy Now, Pay Later）允许消费者在购物时分期付款，通常免息或低息。Klarna、Afterpay、Affirm 是海外主要 BNPL 服务商，国内则有花呗、京东白条等产品。BNPL 的核心价值在于提升转化率（平均提升 20-30%）和客单价（平均提升 30-50%）。</p>\n<p>BNPL 的商业模式对商户的费率较高（3-6%），但通过提升转化和客单价实现正向 ROI。从技术对接角度，BNPL 服务商通常提供重定向（Redirect）和小部件（Widget）两种集成方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>集成方式</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>用户体验</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重定向模式</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>跳转BNPL页面</td>\n<td>快速接入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内嵌Widget</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>商户页面内完成</td>\n<td>主流方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Headless API</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>完全自定义UI</td>\n<td>大型平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>加密货币支付仍处于早期阶段，BitPay 和 Coinbase Commerce 提供商户侧解决方案。稳定币（USDT/USDC）因价格稳定性更适合电商场景。闪电网络（Lightning Network）将比特币的交易确认时间从 10 分钟缩短至秒级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>全球电商支付方式以数字钱包为主导（~49%），卡支付在跨境场景仍不可替代</li>\n<li>卡支付应采用网络令牌化 + 3DS2 组合，提升授权率并转移拒付责任</li>\n<li>支付宝/微信支付是中国市场必选，Apple Pay/Google Pay 通过 Payment Request API 实现无缝集成</li>\n<li>开放银行和 A2A 支付以低费率和实时到账优势，正在重塑欧洲和新兴市场的支付格局</li>\n<li>BNPL 显著提升转化率和客单价，但商户费率较高（3-6%），需评估 ROI</li>\n<li>支付方式的选择应基于目标市场调研，优先覆盖当地市占率前三的支付方式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电商支付方式全景","id":"电商支付方式全景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"卡支付体系","id":"卡支付体系"},{"level":2,"text":"数字钱包生态","id":"数字钱包生态"},{"level":2,"text":"银行转账与开放银行","id":"银行转账与开放银行"},{"level":2,"text":"先买后付与新兴支付","id":"先买后付与新兴支付"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"电商支付生态系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/payment-fundamentals/payment-ecosystem"},"next":{"title":"支付网关架构与集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/payment-fundamentals/payment-gateway"}}